    "Affordable. Quiet. Extremely dark.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affordable. Quiet. Extremely dark."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Günstig. Ruhig. Äußerst dunkel."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asequible. Tranquilo. Extremadamente oscuro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abordable. Calme. Extrêmement sombre."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conveniente. Silenzioso. Estremamente buio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手頃。静か。極めて暗い。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acessível. Silencioso. Extremamente escuro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After all that, Pig finally knew exactly what he wanted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After all that, Pig finally knew exactly what he wanted."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach alledem wusste Pig endlich genau, was er wollte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Después de todo aquello, Pig por fin sabía exactamente qué quería."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après tout cela, Pig savait enfin exactement ce qu'il voulait."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dopo tutto questo, Pig sapeva finalmente cosa voleva."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "そのすべてを経て、Pig はようやく望みを正確に理解しました。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depois de tudo isso, Pig finalmente sabia exatamente o que queria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alleys, rooftops and a pig on the loose. Pizza on the pavement, trash cans along it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alleys, rooftops and a pig on the loose. Pizza on the pavement, trash cans along it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gassen, Dächer und ein Schwein auf freiem Fuß. Pizza auf dem Gehweg, Mülltonnen daneben."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Callejones, tejados y un cerdo suelto. Pizza en la acera, cubos de basura al lado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des ruelles, des toits et un cochon en liberté. De la pizza sur le trottoir, des poubelles le long."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vicoli, tetti e un maiale a piede libero. Pizza sul marciapiede, bidoni lungo di esso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路地と屋根、そして放たれたブタ。歩道にピザ、その脇にゴミ箱。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vielas, telhados e um porco solto. Pizza na calçada, latas de lixo ao longo dela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "And make sure to close the fence. Pig is keeping his options open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "And make sure to close the fence. Pig is keeping his options open."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Und schließ den Zaun. Pig hält sich alle Möglichkeiten offen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Y cierra bien la valla. Pig no descarta nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Et referme bien la clôture. Pig garde toutes ses options ouvertes."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E chiudi bene la recinzione. Pig tiene aperte tutte le opzioni."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "柵は必ず閉じること。Pig は選択肢を開いたままにしたがります。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E feche bem a cerca. Pig mantém todas as opções em aberto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "And that was it. Pig had toured every market imaginable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "And that was it. Pig had toured every market imaginable."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Und das war's. Pig hatte jeden denkbaren Markt besichtigt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Y eso fue todo. Pig había recorrido todos los mercados imaginables."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Et voilà. Pig avait visité tous les marchés imaginables."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E fu tutto. Pig aveva visitato ogni mercato immaginabile."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上。Pig は考えうるすべての市場を回りました。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E era isso. Pig tinha percorrido todos os mercados imagináveis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
