    "Bonus tiles add points. Penalty tiles take points away. Try to fence in the bonus and leave the penalty out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonus tiles add points. Penalty tiles take points away. Try to fence in the bonus and leave the penalty out."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonuskacheln bringen Punkte. Strafkacheln kosten Punkte. Zäune den Bonus ein und lass die Strafe draußen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las casillas de bonus suman puntos. Las de penalización restan. Encierra el bonus y deja fuera la penalización."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les cases bonus rapportent des points. Les cases malus en retirent. Enferme le bonus et laisse le malus dehors."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le caselle bonus danno punti. Quelle penalità li tolgono. Recinta il bonus e lascia fuori la penalità."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ボーナスのマスは加点、ペナルティのマスは減点。ボーナスは囲い、ペナルティは外に。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Casas de bônus somam pontos. Casas de penalidade tiram pontos. Cerque o bônus e deixe a penalidade de fora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them found a gap and showed themselves out. Follow the trails and close them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them found a gap and showed themselves out. Follow the trails and close them."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben eine Lücke gefunden und sich selbst hinausbegleitet. Folge den Spuren und schließ sie."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos encontraron un hueco y se marcharon solos. Sigue los rastros y ciérralos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les deux ont trouvé une brèche et sont sortis seuls. Suis les traces et referme-les."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrambi hanno trovato un varco e se ne sono andati da soli. Segui le tracce e chiudile."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも隙間を見つけて出ていきました。足あとをたどって塞ぎましょう。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois acharam uma brecha e saíram sozinhos. Siga os rastros e feche-os."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but %@'s never touches the water. He keeps a breathing hole, so his ground has to lie against it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but %@'s never touches the water. He keeps a breathing hole, so his ground has to lie against it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben ein Zuhause, aber seines grenzt nie ans Wasser. Er hält sich ein Atemloch, also muss seine Fläche daran liegen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos tienen sitio, pero el suyo nunca toca el agua. Mantiene un respiradero, así que su terreno debe dar al agua."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux ont un coin, mais le sien ne touche jamais l'eau. Il garde un trou pour respirer : son terrain doit donc border l'eau."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanno entrambi un posto, ma il suo non tocca mai l'acqua. Tiene un foro per respirare, quindi il suo terreno deve stare contro l'acqua."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも住まいはありますが、%@のほうが水に接していません。呼吸穴が要るので、その地面は水に沿っていなければなりません。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois têm espaço, mas o dele nunca encosta na água. Ele mantém um respiradouro, então o terreno dele precisa ficar junto à água."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but it is the same place. %@ wants its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but it is the same place. %@ wants its own."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben ein Zuhause, aber dasselbe. %@ will ein eigenes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos tienen sitio, pero es el mismo. %@ quiere el suyo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux ont un coin, mais c'est le même. %@ veut le sien."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanno entrambi un posto, ma è lo stesso. %@ ne vuole uno suo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも住まいはありますが、同じ場所です。%@は自分のものを望んでいます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois têm espaço, mas é o mesmo. %@ quer o próprio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but no channel is wholly %@'s. Every bank of one channel has to be his own ground — half a wallow is nobody's.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but no channel is wholly %@'s. Every bank of one channel has to be his own ground — half a wallow is nobody's."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben ein Zuhause, aber kein Wasserlauf gehört ganz ihm. Jedes Ufer eines Laufs muss seine eigene Fläche sein — eine halbe Suhle gehört niemandem."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos tienen sitio, pero ningún canal es del todo suyo. Cada orilla de un canal debe ser terreno suyo: medio revolcadero no es de nadie."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux ont un coin, mais aucun cours d'eau n'est entièrement le sien. Chaque rive d'un cours d'eau doit être son terrain : une demi-souille n'est à personne."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanno entrambi un posto, ma nessun canale è tutto suo. Ogni riva di un canale deve essere terreno suo: mezza pozza non è di nessuno."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも住まいはありますが、%@のものと言える水路がありません。ある水路の両岸がすべて彼の地面である必要があります。半分のぬた場は誰のものでもありません。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois têm espaço, mas nenhum canal é inteiramente dele. Cada margem de um canal precisa ser terreno dele: meio chafurdo não é de ninguém."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but one each. %@ goes where Pig goes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but one each. %@ goes where Pig goes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben ein Zuhause, aber je eins. %@ gehört dorthin, wo Pig ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos tienen sitio, pero uno cada uno. %@ va donde va Pig."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux ont un coin, mais chacun le sien. %@ va là où va Pig."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanno entrambi un posto, ma uno per ciascuno. %@ sta dove sta Pig."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも住まいはありますが、別々です。%@は Pig と同じ場所に。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois têm espaço, mas um para cada. %@ fica onde Pig fica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but one is bigger. %@ wants ground to match Pig's.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but one is bigger. %@ wants ground to match Pig's."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben ein Zuhause, aber eins ist größer. %@ will genauso viel Fläche wie Pig."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos tienen sitio, pero uno es mayor. %@ quiere tanto terreno como Pig."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux ont un coin, mais l'un est plus grand. %@ veut autant de terrain que Pig."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanno entrambi un posto, ma uno è più grande. %@ vuole tanto terreno quanto Pig."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも住まいはありますが、広さが違います。%@は Pig と同じ広さを望んでいます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois têm espaço, mas um é maior. %@ quer tanto terreno quanto Pig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but one wall does for both — and %@ stings straight through a fence. Leave clear ground between them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but one wall does for both — and %@ stings straight through a fence. Leave clear ground between them."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben ein Zuhause, aber eine Wand dient beiden — und %@ sticht glatt durch einen Zaun. Lass freien Boden dazwischen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos tienen sitio, pero una misma pared sirve a ambos — y %@ pica a través de una valla. Deja terreno libre entre ellos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux ont un coin, mais un seul mur sert aux deux — et %@ pique à travers une clôture. Laisse du terrain libre entre eux."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanno entrambi un posto, ma una sola parete serve a tutti e due — e %@ punge attraverso la recinzione. Lascia del terreno libero in mezzo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも住まいはありますが、壁が共通です。しかも%@は柵越しに刺します。あいだに空き地を。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois têm espaço, mas uma parede serve aos dois — e %@ ferroa através da cerca. Deixe terreno livre entre eles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but side by side. Pig's ground has to go the whole way round %@ — and it is ground she walks, so she needs a clear path the whole way round, with nothing she cannot cross breaking it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but side by side. Pig's ground has to go the whole way round %@ — and it is ground she walks, so she needs a clear path the whole way round, with nothing she cannot cross breaking it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide haben ein Zuhause, aber nebeneinander. Pigs Fläche muss ganz um %@ herumführen — und sie läuft darüber, also braucht sie rundherum einen freien Weg, den nichts Unpassierbares unterbricht."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los dos tienen sitio, pero uno al lado del otro. El terreno de Pig tiene que rodear %@ por completo — y es terreno que ella pisa, así que necesita un camino libre en todo el contorno, sin nada infranqueable que lo corte."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux ont un coin, mais côte à côte. Le terrain de Pig doit faire tout le tour de %@ — et c'est un terrain qu'elle parcourt, il lui faut donc un chemin dégagé sur tout le pourtour, sans rien d'infranchissable pour le couper."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hanno entrambi un posto, ma affiancati. Il terreno di Pig deve girare tutto attorno a %@ — ed è terreno che lei percorre, quindi le serve un passaggio libero lungo tutto il giro, senza nulla di invalicabile a interromperlo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二匹とも住まいはありますが、並んでいるだけです。Pig の地面は%@のまわりを一周しなければなりません。しかもそこは歩く地面なので、通れないものに途切れさせず、一周ぶんの道が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os dois têm espaço, mas lado a lado. O terreno de Pig precisa dar a volta inteira em %@ — e é terreno que ela percorre, então precisa de um caminho livre em toda a volta, sem nada intransponível cortando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both parties requested a little distance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both parties requested a little distance."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beide Seiten baten um etwas Abstand."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ambas partes pidieron algo de distancia."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux parties ont demandé un peu de distance."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrambe le parti chiesero un po' di distanza."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双方とも、少しの距離を希望しました。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ambas as partes pediram um pouco de distância."
          }
        }
      }
    },
