    "Fence in Pig, %@, and his ring. But don't let your fence touch the ring. Apparently it's in the lease.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fence in Pig, %@, and his ring. But don't let your fence touch the ring. Apparently it's in the lease."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zäune Pig, %@ und seine Manege ein. Aber dein Zaun darf die Manege nicht berühren. Steht wohl im Mietvertrag."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encierra a Pig, %@ y su pista. Pero que tu valla no toque la pista. Al parecer está en el contrato."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enferme Pig, %@ et sa piste. Mais que ta clôture ne touche pas la piste. C'est dans le bail, paraît-il."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recinta Pig, %@ e la sua pista. Ma la recinzione non deve toccare la pista. Pare sia nel contratto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pig と%@、そしてリングを囲う。ただし柵をリングに触れさせないこと。契約書にあるらしい。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerque Pig, %@ e o picadeiro dele. Mas não deixe sua cerca encostar no picadeiro. Consta no contrato, pelo visto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fence in Pig, the ringmaster, and his ring. But don't let your fence touch the ring. Apparently it's in the lease.": {
