    "Ice, snow, and a pig that will not stay put.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ice, snow, and a pig that will not stay put."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eis, Schnee und ein Schwein, das nicht stillhält."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hielo, nieve y un cerdo que no para quieto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De la glace, de la neige, et un cochon qui ne tient pas en place."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ghiaccio, neve e un maiale che non sta fermo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "氷と雪、そしてじっとしていないブタ。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gelo, neve e um porco que não fica parado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the game has been worth your time, a rating on the App Store is the single most useful thing you can do for it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the game has been worth your time, a rating on the App Store is the single most useful thing you can do for it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn das Spiel deine Zeit wert war, ist eine Bewertung im App Store das Nützlichste, was du dafür tun kannst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si el juego ha merecido tu tiempo, una valoración en el App Store es lo más útil que puedes hacer por él."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si le jeu a valu ton temps, une note sur l'App Store est la chose la plus utile que tu puisses faire pour lui."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se il gioco è valso il tuo tempo, una valutazione sull'App Store è la cosa più utile che puoi fare per lui."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このゲームが時間に見合うものだったなら、App Store での評価がいちばんの力になります。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se o jogo valeu seu tempo, uma avaliação na App Store é a coisa mais útil que você pode fazer por ele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It found a gap and showed itself out while the other stayed put — and both of them need a place. Follow the trail and close it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It found a gap and showed itself out while the other stayed put — and both of them need a place. Follow the trail and close it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es hat eine Lücke gefunden und ist gegangen, während das andere geblieben ist — und beide brauchen ein Zuhause. Folge der Spur und schließ sie."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encontró un hueco y se marchó mientras el otro se quedaba, y los dos necesitan sitio. Sigue el rastro y ciérralo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a trouvé une brèche et est sorti pendant que l'autre restait — et les deux ont besoin d'un coin. Suis la trace et referme-la."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha trovato un varco e se n'è andato mentre l'altro restava — e servono un posto a entrambi. Segui la traccia e chiudila."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片方は隙間から出ていき、もう片方は残りました。二匹とも住まいが必要です。足あとをたどって塞ぎましょう。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Achou uma brecha e saiu enquanto o outro ficou — e os dois precisam de espaço. Siga o rastro e feche-o."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It found a gap and showed itself out. Follow the trail and close it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It found a gap and showed itself out. Follow the trail and close it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es hat eine Lücke gefunden und sich selbst hinausbegleitet. Folge der Spur und schließ sie."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encontró un hueco y se marchó solo. Sigue el rastro y ciérralo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a trouvé une brèche et est sorti seul. Suis la trace et referme-la."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha trovato un varco e se n'è andato da solo. Segui la traccia e chiudila."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隙間を見つけて出ていきました。足あとをたどって塞ぎましょう。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Achou uma brecha e saiu sozinho. Siga o rastro e feche-o."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was certainly more lively than the cave.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
