    "The practice pen, start to finish: laying a fence, dragging a run of it, what a bonus and a penalty are worth, and what shutting the pig in is worth.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The practice pen, start to finish: laying a fence, dragging a run of it, what a bonus and a penalty are worth, and what shutting the pig in is worth."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Übungsgehege von Anfang bis Ende: einen Zaun setzen, eine Reihe davon ziehen, was ein Bonus und eine Strafe wert sind und was es bringt, das Schwein einzuschließen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El corral de práctica de principio a fin: colocar valla, arrastrar un tramo, cuánto valen un bonus y una penalización, y cuánto vale encerrar al cerdo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'enclos d'entraînement de bout en bout : poser une clôture, en tirer une série, ce que valent un bonus et un malus, et ce que vaut d'enfermer le cochon."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il recinto di prova dall'inizio alla fine: posare una recinzione, trascinarne un tratto, quanto valgono un bonus e una penalità, e quanto vale chiudere dentro il maiale."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "練習用の囲いをひととおり。柵を置く、なぞって続けて置く、ボーナスとペナルティの価値、そしてブタを閉じこめる価値。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O curral de prática do começo ao fim: colocar cerca, arrastar um trecho, quanto valem um bônus e uma penalidade, e quanto vale fechar o porco lá dentro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The property was already occupied. Twice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The property was already occupied. Twice."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Objekt war bereits belegt. Zweifach."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La finca ya estaba ocupada. Dos veces."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bien était déjà occupé. Deux fois."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'immobile era già occupato. Due volte."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その物件はすでに入居済み。二重に。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O imóvel já estava ocupado. Duas vezes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rat was not leaving. The rat had never considered leaving.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rat was not leaving. The rat had never considered leaving."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Ratte ging nicht. Die Ratte hatte nie daran gedacht zu gehen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La rata no se iba. La rata nunca se lo había planteado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le rat ne partait pas. Le rat n'y avait jamais songé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il ratto non se ne andava. Non ci aveva mai pensato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ネズミは出ていきません。出ていく気は最初からありません。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O rato não ia sair. O rato nunca cogitou sair."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ringmaster runs a tight ship. Keep your construction out of his personal space.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ringmaster runs a tight ship. Keep your construction out of his personal space."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Zirkusdirektor führt ein strenges Regiment. Halte deinen Bau aus seinem Bereich heraus."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El maestro de ceremonias lleva las riendas cortas. Que tu obra no invada su espacio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le maître de piste tient sa baraque d'une main de fer. Que ta construction reste hors de son espace."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il direttore di pista non lascia nulla al caso. Tieni la tua costruzione fuori dal suo spazio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "団長の管理は厳格。彼の領域に工事を入れないこと。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O mestre de pista comanda com rigor. Mantenha sua obra fora do espaço dele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The seal wanted its own place. With water access. Non-negotiable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The seal wanted its own place. With water access. Non-negotiable."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Seebulle wollte sein eigenes Zuhause. Mit Wasserzugang. Nicht verhandelbar."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La foca quería su propio sitio. Con acceso al agua. Innegociable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le phoque voulait son propre coin. Avec accès à l'eau. Non négociable."
          }
